# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lucky Store POS — Root .gitignore
# Monorepo: Flutter, Next.js/Node, Supabase, Cloudflare, and local tooling
# Policy-preserving reorganization of the 2026-11-10 reviewed file.
# Broad legacy exclusions are intentionally retained pending separate review.
# IMPORTANT: order matters for negations; keep adjacent exception chains together.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# =============================================================================
# 01. Environment and secrets
# =============================================================================

# Keep the environment exception chain intact, including deliberate repeated exceptions.
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.secrets
!.env.example
!.env.secrets.example

# Application environment files and reviewed examples.
apps/*/.env
apps/*/.env.*
!apps/*/.env.example
apps/mobile_app/env/*
!apps/mobile_app/env/.env.example

# Wrangler local secret files.
**/.dev.vars

# Key and certificate material.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.csr
*client_secret*.json

# Flutter bundled configuration (legacy policy).
apps/mobile_app/assets/app.env

